{"id":"3a47eea6cc9e560d","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup.md","title":"Linearly Ordered Unital Abelian ℓ-Group","display":"df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup — Linearly Ordered Unital Abelian ℓ-Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup","aliases":["93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup"],"display":"df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup — Linearly Ordered Unital Abelian ℓ-Group","depends_on":["[[93-df-lattice]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup — Linearly Ordered Unital Abelian ℓ-Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf G\">\\(\\mathbf G\\)</span> is a six-component ordered-group candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> is a strong-unit candidate.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> is the lattice class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e)\">\\(\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e)\\)</span> is the explicitly basepoint-indexed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-fold iteration of a prospective addition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbf G|\">\\(|\\mathbf G|\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+^{\\mathbf G}\">\\(+^{\\mathbf G}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-^{\\mathbf G}\">\\(-^{\\mathbf G}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^{\\mathbf G}\">\\(0^{\\mathbf G}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge^{\\mathbf G}\">\\(\\wedge^{\\mathbf G}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee^{\\mathbf G}\">\\(\\vee^{\\mathbf G}\\)</span> are the projections defined here for six-component candidates.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e)\">\\(\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists G\\in V\\;(p:G^2\\to G\\land e,u\\in G)\">\\(\\exists G\\in V\\;(p:G^2\\to G\\land e,u\\in G)\\)</span>；这里只要求迭代所需的闭合二元运算，不预设群公理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>六元组投影的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle\">\\(\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle\\)</span>，其中各分量为集合。下方中缀与前缀等式分别在其显示的运算类型和输入域内定义记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 直接以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中的元素为自变量，不使用二元代数结构码中的单元组约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\leq_{\\mathbf G}y\">\\(x\\leq_{\\mathbf G}y\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf G=\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbf G=\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:G^2\\to G\">\\(m:G^2\\to G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span>；这些局部定义域条件不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\">\\(\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\n\\vdash\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(0,u;p,e)&amp;\\coloneqq e,\\\\\n\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k+1,u;p,e)&amp;\\coloneqq\np(\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e),u)\n\\qquad(k\\in\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\n\\vdash\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(0,u;p,e)&amp;\\coloneqq e,\\\\\n\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k+1,u;p,e)&amp;\\coloneqq\np(\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e),u)\n\\qquad(k\\in\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\n\\vdash |\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle|&amp;\\coloneqq G,\\\\\n(+)^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq p,\\\\\n(-)^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq q,\\\\\n0^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq e,\\\\\n\\wedge^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq m,\\\\\n\\vee^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq j.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\n\\vdash |\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle|&amp;\\coloneqq G,\\\\\n(+)^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq p,\\\\\n(-)^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq q,\\\\\n0^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq e,\\\\\n\\wedge^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq m,\\\\\n\\vee^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq j.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a+^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}b\\coloneqq p(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\n\\quad(p:G^2\\to G,\\ a,b\\in G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a+^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}b\\coloneqq p(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\n\\quad(p:G^2\\to G,\\ a,b\\in G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"-^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}a\\coloneqq q(a)\n\\quad(q:G\\to G,\\ a\\in G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[-^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}a\\coloneqq q(a)\n\\quad(q:G\\to G,\\ a\\in G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}b\\coloneqq m(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\n\\quad(m:G^2\\to G,\\ a,b\\in G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}b\\coloneqq m(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\n\\quad(m:G^2\\to G,\\ a,b\\in G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\vee^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}b\\coloneqq j(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\n\\quad(j:G^2\\to G,\\ a,b\\in G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\vee^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}b\\coloneqq j(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\n\\quad(j:G^2\\to G,\\ a,b\\in G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\n\\vdash\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists G\\;\\exists p\\;\\exists q\\;\\exists e\\;\\exists m\\;\\exists j\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathbf G=\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle\n\\land\\langle G,m,j\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\n\\land p:G^2\\to G\\land q:G\\to G\\land e,u\\in G\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in G\\;\\bigl(\np(p(a,b),c)=p(a,p(b,c))\\land p(a,b)=p(b,a)\n\\land p(a,e)=a\\land p(a,q(a))=e\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in G\\;\\bigl(\nm(a,b)=a\\to m(p(a,c),p(b,c))=p(a,c)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;(m(a,b)=a\\lor m(b,a)=b)\n\\land m(e,u)=e\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in G\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nm(a,\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e))=a\n\\land m(q(a),\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e))=q(a)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\n\\vdash\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists G\\;\\exists p\\;\\exists q\\;\\exists e\\;\\exists m\\;\\exists j\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathbf G=\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle\n\\land\\langle G,m,j\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\n\\land p:G^2\\to G\\land q:G\\to G\\land e,u\\in G\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in G\\;\\bigl(\np(p(a,b),c)=p(a,p(b,c))\\land p(a,b)=p(b,a)\n\\land p(a,e)=a\\land p(a,q(a))=e\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in G\\;\\bigl(\nm(a,b)=a\\to m(p(a,c),p(b,c))=p(a,c)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;(m(a,b)=a\\lor m(b,a)=b)\n\\land m(e,u)=e\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in G\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nm(a,\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e))=a\n\\land m(q(a),\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e))=q(a)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\\vdash\nx\\leq_{\\mathbf G}y\\leftrightarrow\nx,y\\in|\\mathbf G|\\land x\\wedge^{\\mathbf G}y=x\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\\vdash\nx\\leq_{\\mathbf G}y\\leftrightarrow\nx,y\\in|\\mathbf G|\\land x\\wedge^{\\mathbf G}y=x\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every component of the two-place predicate is bound by the displayed decomposition, and the projection equations make downstream interval constructions unambiguous. The neutral element used at the zero stage of repeated addition is an explicit constructor argument. The final clause is the strong-unit condition; totality distinguishes the group representing an MV-chain from a merely lattice-ordered group.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf G","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathbf G|","display":false},{"tex":"+^{\\mathbf G}","display":false},{"tex":"-^{\\mathbf G}","display":false},{"tex":"0^{\\mathbf G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge^{\\mathbf G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vee^{\\mathbf G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists G\\in V\\;(p:G^2\\to G\\land e,u\\in G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"x\\leq_{\\mathbf G}y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf G=\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"m:G^2\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\n\\vdash\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(0,u;p,e)&\\coloneqq e,\\\\\n\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k+1,u;p,e)&\\coloneqq\np(\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e),u)\n\\qquad(k\\in\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\n\\vdash |\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle|&\\coloneqq G,\\\\\n(+)^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&\\coloneqq p,\\\\\n(-)^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&\\coloneqq q,\\\\\n0^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&\\coloneqq e,\\\\\n\\wedge^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&\\coloneqq m,\\\\\n\\vee^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}&\\coloneqq j.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"a+^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}b\\coloneqq p(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\n\\quad(p:G^2\\to G,\\ a,b\\in G)","display":true},{"tex":"-^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}a\\coloneqq q(a)\n\\quad(q:G\\to G,\\ a\\in G)","display":true},{"tex":"a\\wedge^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}b\\coloneqq m(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\n\\quad(m:G^2\\to G,\\ a,b\\in G)","display":true},{"tex":"a\\vee^{\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle}b\\coloneqq j(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\n\\quad(j:G^2\\to G,\\ a,b\\in G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\n\\vdash\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\quad\\exists G\\;\\exists p\\;\\exists q\\;\\exists e\\;\\exists m\\;\\exists j\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathbf G=\\langle G,p,q,e,m,j\\rangle\n\\land\\langle G,m,j\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\n\\land p:G^2\\to G\\land q:G\\to G\\land e,u\\in G\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in G\\;\\bigl(\np(p(a,b),c)=p(a,p(b,c))\\land p(a,b)=p(b,a)\n\\land p(a,e)=a\\land p(a,q(a))=e\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in G\\;\\bigl(\nm(a,b)=a\\to m(p(a,c),p(b,c))=p(a,c)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;(m(a,b)=a\\lor m(b,a)=b)\n\\land m(e,u)=e\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in G\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nm(a,\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e))=a\n\\land m(q(a),\\operatorname{NatMul}_{93}(k,u;p,e))=q(a)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}unital\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}lgroup}\\vdash\nx\\leq_{\\mathbf G}y\\leftrightarrow\nx,y\\in|\\mathbf G|\\land x\\wedge^{\\mathbf G}y=x","display":true}],"bytes":4178,"backlinks":[{"id":"18380974697f948b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)$ is defined in [[93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup]]."}],"outgoing":["3b5f38bd115ed203","e30eac382dc7d1a7"]}